                                "sense_id": "3a803b7a-74e1-34c4-915f-5cd143b828c6",
                                "text": "On this score, monastics are will-positioned, in that one of the purposes of monastic work was to recreate the garden of paradise. The Cistercians, however, have not made a move to undrain the swamps."
                            },
                            {
